/v1/","context":{"app_id":2361090,"app_scope":"base","country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100,"review_scope":"store_summary_filtered","percentage_precision":"source_rounded_integer","review_score_label":"사용자 평가 없음"},"error_code":"no_reviews"},{"game_id":"steam-2361090","metric":"demo_ccu","observed_at":"2026-10-26T07:31:57Z","value":0,"status":"ok","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/ISteamUserStats/GetNumberOfCurrentPlayers/v1/?appid=5293680","error_code":null}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-2361090-1847286114038364","game_id":"steam-2361090","kind":"announcement","title":"What’s Your Go-To Weapon Combo?","summary":"Do you stick with a favorite starting weapon, or change course after a useful shop find? We’d like to hear what you’ve been taking into the free Starcore Survivor demo. Your next weapon doesn’t have to do the same job as your first. Try a partner that handles a different kind of threat, then see what suits the way you move. Give each weapon a job Try Rail Needle alongside Starfire Coil. Rail Needle sends a guided shot towards a priority target, while the Coil chains hits between nearby enemies. ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-24T00:00:20Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114038364","verified_at":"2026-10-24T04:14:40Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2361090-1847286114034496","game_id":"steam-2361090","kind":"announcement","title":"Weapon Fusion and Evolution: How They Work","summary":"Bought another Scatter Cannon and watched it combine with the one you already had? That’s fusion. Reaching T4 is a different milestone from evolving a weapon—and knowing the difference can change what you look for in the next shop. Here’s how both work in Starcore Survivor, starting with a purchase you can make between waves. Match the weapon. Match the tier. Check your current weapons and the shop offer. When you buy a weapon with the same name and tier as one you own, the pair automatically co","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-23T00:00:09Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114034496","verified_at":"2026-10-23T00:47:11Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2361090-1847286114031385","game_id":"steam-2361090","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update: Controller Support Is Here!","summary":"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/46254652/ba30c414128fb66993a5a09130fbf9f36f4bfdc7.png We’ve added controller support to the Starcore Survivor demo! Update to the latest version, grab your controller, and give it a try. A quick thank-you to Broxi1979 for bringing up controller support on Steam Deck. We appreciate you taking the time to share your feedback. Trying it on Steam Deck? If you’re trying the updated demo on Steam Deck, we’d love to hear how it goes. If anything doesn’t work as expected, let us know ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-22T06:18:49Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114031385","verified_at":"2026-10-22T08:38:13Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2361090-1847286114030791","game_id":"steam-2361090","kind":"announcement","title":"First Run Tips: What to Pick and What to Upgrade","summary":"https://clan.fastly.steamstatic.com/images/46254652/129bddb959301c669eca4811edc7384d3e653371.jpg You’ve made it through a wave. Time to shop. What should you spend your materials on? Your weapons fire automatically, but you still have plenty of choices to make. Here are a few things to try on your first run—without needing a perfect build or memorizing every item. Before chasing materials, look for a gap you can move through. Use the opening waves to see which enemies your starting weapon hits a","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-22T01:24:48Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114030791","verified_at":"2026-10-22T03:06:45Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2361090-1847286114027384","game_id":"steam-2361090","kind":"announcement","title":"Weapon Spotlight 06: Return Ring — Strike in Four Directions","summary":"A single volley, four directions. Return Ring sends green rings outward from your core, alternating between a cross and an X with each attack. Track where enemies gather and turn your movement into a way to line up the next piercing volley. https://clan.fastly.steamstatic.com/images/46254652/830cf75c837e2c858aedf0856eb40df364d072c4.gif Return Ring in action — 3 seconds of real gameplay with a single T1 weapon during Wave 2. Think in firing lanes Watch the pattern change. Volleys alternate betwee","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-21T03:00:36Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114027384","verified_at":"2026-10-21T10:48:57Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2361090-1847286114027231","game_id":"steam-2361090","kind":"announcement","title":"Weapon Spotlight 05: Starfire Coil — Chain Lightning, Unleashed","summary":"A tight pack is an invitation to start a chain. Starfire Coil sends electricity jumping between nearby foes, turning clustered enemies into a sequence of hits. Meet one of the six starting weapons in the free Starcore Survivor demo, and put the crowd at the heart of your next build. https://clan.fastly.steamstatic.com/images/46254652/684e83beecb2b3d4e3834bd7679eba1fdb466e65.gif Starfire Coil in action — 3 seconds of real gameplay with a single T1 weapon during Wave 2. Make every jump count Turn ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-21T01:30:31Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114027231","verified_at":"2026-10-21T10:48:57Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2361090-1847286114027065","game_id":"steam-2361090","kind":"announcement","title":"Weapon Spotlight 04: Rail Needle — Priority Target. Locked.","summary":"Pick out the threat. Follow the blue trail. Rail Needle automatically selects a priority enemy and sends a guided projectile toward it, curving its flight as the target moves. It brings focused single-target fire to your starting loadout while you keep your core on the move. https://clan.fastly.steamstatic.com/images/46254652/b7523fb02bba670e8096ed10b656aa596afbd0e5.gif Rail Needle in action — 3 seconds of real gameplay with a single T1 weapon during Wave 2. Give priority threats your attention ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-21T00:00:27Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114027065","verified_at":"2026-10-21T01:01:14Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2361090-1846651706693417","game_id":"steam-2361090","kind":"announcement","title":"Weapon Spotlight 03: Arc Blade — Cut Through the Crowd","summary":"https://clan.fastly.steamstatic.com/images/46254652/4e8e9a9f3b9a2874193636e6fb525376e9c1d8b1.png Bring the swarm into sweeping range. Arc Blade sends a pink cutting arc around your core, catching nearby enemies in the same attack. Every turn along the edge of a group is a chance to draw pursuers into your next sweep. https://clan.fastly.steamstatic.com/images/46254652/f4a6e154cb1a79de95b1f4f2645911b96d1a2cef.gif Arc Blade in action — 3 seconds of real gameplay with a single T1 weapon during Wave","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-20T02:28:56Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706693417","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:02:49Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2361090-1846651706691034","game_id":"steam-2361090","kind":"announcement","title":"Weapon Spotlight 02: Scatter Cannon — Close In. Clear Out.","summary":"https://clan.fastly.steamstatic.com/images/46254652/ec1d16986e379d7437d310f7ff19e3715093c791.png Close the gap. Make the spread count. Scatter Cannon sends a fan of shots toward approaching enemies, with close-range positioning bringing more pellets onto a target. This starting weapon turns your choice of distance into a satisfying part of every volley. https://clan.fastly.steamstatic.com/images/46254652/0a7a15b1c5d70e91b19d7ae4742ecca09166664a.gif Scatter Cannon in action — 3 seconds of real ga","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T16:18:18Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706691034","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:02:49Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2361090-1846651706688317","game_id":"steam-2361090","kind":"announcement","title":"Weapon Spotlight 01: Pulse Rifle — Keep the Pressure On","summary":"https://clan.fastly.steamstatic.com/images/46254652/80cb046c1147cfc349215e8844343392f528a357.png A crowd is approaching, but your next target is already in front of you. Pulse Rifle delivers short, repeated beams into a single enemy while you keep your core moving. It is one of the six starting weapons in the free Starcore Survivor demo—and a straightforward place to start experimenting with your loadout. https://clan.fastly.steamstatic.com/images/46254652/4167c87d897f272d7ef835356c9c7c54efc42ce","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-18T23:43:20Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706688317","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:02:49Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2361090-1846651706680591","game_id":"steam-2361090","kind":"announcement","title":"Starcore Survivor — The Free Demo Is Out Now. Which Weapon Will You Choose?","summary":"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/46254652/82684011aadeb1644f58bfac9b8509edd674b715.png","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-16T08:39:59Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706680591","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:02:49Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2361090-1843481262701385","game_id":"steam-2361090","kind":"announcement","title":"Meet the Amber Strider","summary":"Meet the Amber Strider Something faster has joined the swarm. https://clan.fastly.steamstatic.com/images/46254652/5d1957895b54577c4d8ec03b1cbd3c0069572dcf.png The Amber Strider moves quicker than the standard drones, closing the gap before you have time to react. You’ll know it by the orange armor. And as the run goes on, you’ll be seeing more than one problem at a time. The horde gets denser, enemies arrive faster, and the deck gets harder to keep under control. The Amber Strider is one of the ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-14T11:06:50Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262701385","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:02:49Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2361090-1842212951306984","game_id":"steam-2361090","kind":"announcement","title":"The First Sector Is Fighting Back","summary":"Something has changed in the first sector.The deeper you push, the more the battlefield seems 